","name":{"zh-Hans":"滇缅公路惠通桥"},"address":{"zh-Hans":"云南省保山市龙陵县 怒江上的惠通桥（滇缅公路咽喉，具体位置以导航为准）"},"note":{"zh-Hans":"第八批国保（1935 年）。华侨梁金山捐建的钢索吊桥，是滇缅公路跨越怒江的咽喉；1942 年 5 月为阻日军过江将桥炸毁，今桥为后来重建。桥在怒江峡谷里，离龙陵县城还有一段山路，以现场路况为准。"},"status":"extant","since":"1935","sources":[{"ref":"source.国保名录"},{"ref":"source.web.惠通桥"}]}]},{"id":"route.nw-supply","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"西北国际交通线"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"中苏西北交通线"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937","end":"1941","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[80.42,44.2],[81.32,43.92],[82.9,44.6],[84.68,44.43],[87.62,43.79],[89.19,42.95],[93.51,42.83],[95.78,40.52],[98.49,39.73],[100.45,38.93],[103.83,36.06]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"霍尔果斯"},"coord":[80.42,44.2]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"迪化"},"coord":[87.62,43.79]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"哈密"},"coord":[93.51,42.83]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"兰州"},"coord":[103.83,36.06]}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.wiki.西北国际交通线"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1937 年抗战全面爆发后开辟的陆路通道：苏联援华物资经霍尔果斯入境，走伊宁—迪化—哈密—兰州，再从兰州分运各战区。1937–1941 年间运进飞机、坦克、火炮与油料，是太平洋战争前中国最重要的外援通道；1941 年苏德战争爆发后基本停运。路线为示意线。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.balu-dongdu-1937","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"八路军东渡黄河（云阳—五台）"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-08-22","end":"1937-09-25","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[108.72,34.62],[110.44,35.47],[111.37,35.62],[111.52,36.08],[112.55,37.87],[113.25,38.73]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"云阳镇"},"coord":[108.72,34.62],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-08-22","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"韩城芝川渡口"},"coord":[110.44,35.47],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-09","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"侯马"},"coord":[111.37,35.62]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"太原"},"coord":[112.55,37.87]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"五台"},"coord":[113.25,38.73],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-09","precision":"month"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"},{"ref":"source.wiki.八路军"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1937 年 8 月下旬八路军总部与第一一五师、一二〇师、一二九师自陕西泾阳云阳镇出发，由韩城芝川东渡黄河，经侯马乘火车北上，9 月进入晋东北，总部一度驻五台。"},"tags":["路线","行军","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.xinsijun-yunling-1938","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"新四军军部进驻云岭（南昌—泾县）"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-04","end":"1938-08","precision":"month"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[115.89,28.68],[117.18,29.27],[118.34,29.87],[118.42,30.68]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南昌"},"coord":[115.89,28.68],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-04","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"景德镇"},"coord":[117.18,29.27]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"岩寺"},"coord":[118.34,29.87],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-04","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"泾县云岭"},"coord":[118.42,30.68],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-08","precision":"month"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"},{"ref":"source.wiki.新四军"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1938 年 4 月新四军军部与各支队在皖南岩寺集中整编，随后军部移驻泾县云岭，直至 1941 年皖南事变。"},"tags":["路线","行军","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.xinsijun-sunan-1938","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"新四军一支队挺进苏南（岩寺—茅山）"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-05","end":"1938-06","precision":"month"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.34,29.87],[119.03,31.65],[119.33,31.77]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"岩寺"},"coord":[118.34,29.87]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"溧水"},"coord":[119.03,31.65],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-05","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"茅山"},"coord":[119.33,31.77],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-06","precision":"month"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"},{"ref":"source.wiki.新四军"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1938 年 5 月新四军第一支队在陈毅率领下由皖南东进，经溧水进入苏南，以茅山为中心开辟抗日根据地，6 月 17 日在韦岗伏击日军。"},"tags":["路线","行军","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.yiyiwushi-lunan-1939","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"一一五师主力入鲁（晋西—鲁南）"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1939-03","end":"1939-09","precision":"month"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[110.94,36.69],[113.67,36.58],[115.03,35.76],[115.94,35.6],[117.65,34.98]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"隰县"},"coord":[110.94,36.69]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"涉县"},"coord":[113.67,36.58]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"濮阳"},"coord":[115.03,35.76]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"郓城"},"coord":[115.94,35.6]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"抱犊崮"},"coord":[117.65,34.98],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1939-09","precision":"month"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"},{"ref":"source.wiki.八路军"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1939 年 3 月起八路军第一一五师主力由晋西经冀南、鲁西向山东挺进，9 月进入鲁南，与山东纵队会合，山东敌后战场由此成片。"},"tags":["路线","行军","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.longmarch-1934","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"长征（中央红军，瑞金—吴起镇）"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1934-10-10","end":"1935-10-19","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[116.03,25.88],[114.92,25.39],[112.95,25.4],[111.34,25.53],[110.67,25.61],[109.78,26.16],[109.14,26.23],[107.35,27.25],[106.93,27.7],[106.01,28.31],[105.7,28.58],[106.37,27.82],[102.16,26.6],[102.25,26.66],[102.35,29.26],[102.23,29.91],[102.36,30.99],[103,32.6],[103.6,34.07],[104.39,34.2],[105,35.2],[108.18,36.93]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"瑞金"},"coord":[116.03,25.88],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1934-10-10","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"兴安界首"},"coord":[110.67,25.61],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1934-11-27","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"通道"},"coord":[109.78,26.16],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1934-12-12","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"黎平"},"coord":[109.14,26.23],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1934-12-18","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"乌江"},"coord":[107.35,27.25],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-01","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"遵义"},"coord":[106.93,27.7],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-01","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"土城"},"coord":[106.01,28.31],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-01","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"赤水"},"coord":[105.7,28.58],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-02","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"茅台"},"coord":[106.37,27.82],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-03","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"皎平渡"},"coord":[102.16,26.6],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-05","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"安顺场"},"coord":[102.35,29.26],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-05","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"泸定"},"coord":[102.23,29.91],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-05","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"懋功"},"coord":[102.36,30.99],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-06","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"毛儿盖"},"coord":[103,32.6],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-08","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"腊子口"},"coord":[103.6,34.07],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-09","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"哈达铺"},"coord":[104.39,34.2],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-09","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"吴起镇"},"coord":[108.18,36.93],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1935-10-19","precision":"day"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"},{"ref":"source.wiki.长征"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1934 年 10 月中央红军自瑞金出发，经湘江、通道、黎平入黔，1935 年 1 月占遵义；此后四渡赤水、巧渡金沙江、强渡大渡河、飞夺泸定桥，过雪山草地在懋功与红四方面军会合，9 月突破腊子口，10 月 19 日到陕北吴起镇。"},"tags":["路线","行军","土地革命"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-dianyue","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"入滇·海路（长沙—香港—海防—昆明）"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"临大迁滇海路"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-02","end":"1938-04","precision":"month"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[112.94,28.23],[113.26,23.13],[114.17,22.3],[112.5,21.5],[110.4,20.9],[108.3,21.6],[106.68,20.86],[105.85,21.03],[103.98,22.49],[103.94,22.51],[103.38,23.36],[103.26,23.71],[102.71,25.04]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"长沙"},"coord":[112.94,28.23]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"广州"},"coord":[113.26,23.13],"role":"粤汉铁路"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"香港"},"coord":[114.17,22.3],"role":"广九铁路转海船"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"海防"},"coord":[106.68,20.86],"role":"海船"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"河内"},"coord":[105.85,21.03]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"昆明"},"coord":[102.71,25.04],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-03","precision":"month"},"role":"滇越铁路"}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.西南联大从长沙到昆明"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"入滇海路：大部分教师、家眷、全体女生与体弱男生走这一路——长沙经粤汉铁路到广州，转广九铁路到香港，再乘海船到越南海防，由滇越铁路经河内、老街、河口、蒙自入昆明。它是三条路里最省体力的一条，也要绕行上千公里。示意线，海上段为直线，不代表实际航线。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","西南联大","入滇"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-yuenan","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"入滇·陆路经越南（长沙—桂林—龙州—河内—昆明）"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"临大迁滇陆路"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-02","end":"1938-03","precision":"month"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[112.94,28.23],[112.57,26.89],[110.29,25.27],[109.41,24.33],[106.85,22.34],[105.85,21.03],[103.98,22.49],[103.94,22.51],[103.38,23.36],[103.26,23.71],[102.71,25.04]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"长沙"},"coord":[112.94,28.23],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-02-16","precision":"day"},"role":"朱自清 2 月 16 日离南岳"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"桂林"},"coord":[110.29,25.27],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-02-17","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"柳州"},"coord":[109.41,24.33],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-02-24","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"龙州"},"coord":[106.85,22.34],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-02-26","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"河内"},"coord":[105.85,21.03],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-03-02","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"昆明"},"coord":[102.71,25.04],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-03-14","precision":"day"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.西南联大从长沙到昆明"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"入滇陆路：冯友兰、朱自清、陈岱孙、钱穆等少数教师走这一路——长沙经衡阳、桂林、柳州、龙州出镇南关入越南，再到河内，由滇越铁路入昆明。朱自清日记记得很细：2 月 16 日离南岳，17 日到桂林，24 日宿柳州，26 日到龙州，3 月 2 日赴河内，3 月 14 日抵昆明，前后近一个月。示意线。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","西南联大","入滇"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-buxing","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"入滇·湘黔滇步行团"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"湘黔滇旅行团"},{"zh-Hans":"长沙—昆明步行路线"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1938-02-20","end":"1938-04-28","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[112.94,28.23],[112.36,28.55],[111.7,29.03],[111.49,28.9],[110.39,28.46],[109.68,27.44],[109.17,27.36],[108.92,27.24],[108.42,27.05],[106.63,26.65],[105.93,26.25],[104.47,25.71],[103.8,25.49],[102.71,25.04]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"长沙"},"coord":[112.94,28.23],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-02-20","precision":"day"},"role":"开拔"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"益阳"},"coord":[112.36,28.55]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"常德"},"coord":[111.7,29.03]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"桃源"},"coord":[111.49,28.9],"role":"自此舍舟步行"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"沅陵"},"coord":[110.39,28.46]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"芷江"},"coord":[109.68,27.44]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"晃县"},"coord":[109.17,27.36]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"玉屏"},"coord":[108.92,27.24]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"镇远"},"coord":[108.42,27.05]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"贵阳"},"coord":[106.63,26.65]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"安顺"},"coord":[105.93,26.25]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"盘县"},"coord":[104.47,25.71]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"曲靖"},"coord":[103.8,25.49]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"昆明"},"coord":[102.71,25.04],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-04-28","precision":"day"},"role":"抵昆明"}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.西南联大从长沙到昆明"},{"ref":"source.web.湘黔滇旅行团"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"湘黔滇步行团路线：1938 年 2 月 20 日自长沙出发，经益阳、常德、桃源，3 月 1 日自桃源舍舟步行，过沅陵、芷江、晃县入贵州，经玉屏、镇远到贵阳、安顺，再经盘县入云南，4 月 28 日抵昆明。全程约 3,500 里、68 天。示意线，按沿途宿站连成。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","西南联大","步行团"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-changjiang","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"大撤退·长江航线（沪—汉—渝）"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"长江大撤退航线"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-11","end":"1938-11","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[121.47,31.23],[118.78,32.06],[118.38,31.33],[117.05,30.53],[116,29.71],[114.3,30.59],[111.29,30.69],[108.41,30.81],[106.55,29.56]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"上海"},"coord":[121.47,31.23]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南京"},"coord":[118.78,32.06]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"芜湖"},"coord":[118.38,31.33]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"安庆"},"coord":[117.05,30.53]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"九江"},"coord":[116,29.71]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"武汉"},"coord":[114.3,30.59],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-10","precision":"month"},"role":"武汉撤退"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"宜昌"},"coord":[111.29,30.69],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-10","precision":"month"},"role":"四十天抢运"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"重庆"},"coord":[106.55,29.56]}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.宜昌大撤退"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"长江航线：从上海、南京一路西撤的机关、学校、工厂与难民，经芜湖、安庆、九江到武汉；武汉危急后，人员和器材在宜昌换小船入川，到万县、重庆。1938 年 10 月宜昌积压 3 万余人、9 万吨器材，卢作孚用 40 天运出三分之二。示意线，水路为主。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","大撤退","长江"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-longhai","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"大撤退·陇海—宝鸡—汉中—成都"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"陇海线西撤"},{"zh-Hans":"西北入川通道"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-11","end":"1940","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[113.63,34.75],[112.45,34.62],[108.94,34.34],[107.14,34.37],[107.02,33.07],[105.84,32.44],[104.07,30.67]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"郑州"},"coord":[113.63,34.75]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"洛阳"},"coord":[112.45,34.62]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"西安"},"coord":[108.94,34.34]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"宝鸡"},"coord":[107.14,34.37],"role":"陇海线终点，转公路"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"汉中"},"coord":[107.02,33.07]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"广元"},"coord":[105.84,32.44]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"成都"},"coord":[104.07,30.67]}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"陇海—宝汉蓉通道：郑州、洛阳、西安沿陇海铁路西行到宝鸡，再走川陕公路翻秦岭到汉中，经广元入成都。抗战前期，北方的学校、工厂和故宫文物都走过这一段；宝鸡到汉中 254 公里，除两端外都在秦岭里盘旋。示意线。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","大撤退","西北"]},{"id":"route.da-qianyi-zhegan","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"大撤退·浙赣—湘桂"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"浙赣湘桂西撤"},{"zh-Hans":"东南入桂通道"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1939","end":"1944","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[120.16,30.27],[115.89,28.68],[113.13,27.83],[112.57,26.89],[110.29,25.27],[109.41,24.33],[108.37,22.82]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"杭州"},"coord":[120.16,30.27]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南昌"},"coord":[115.89,28.68]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"株洲"},"coord":[113.13,27.83],"role":"浙赣线接粤汉线"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"衡阳"},"coord":[112.57,26.89]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"桂林"},"coord":[110.29,25.27]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"柳州"},"coord":[109.41,24.33]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南宁"},"coord":[108.37,22.82]}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.宜昌大撤退"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"浙赣—湘桂通道：东南各省的物资、学校与人员先沿浙赣铁路西行到株洲，转粤汉线南下衡阳，再沿湘桂铁路到桂林、柳州、南宁。1939 年湘桂铁路通到柳州，1944 年日军打通大陆交通线时，这条通道又被切断。示意线。"},"tags":["路线","抗日战争","大撤退","东南"]},{"id":"route.wenwu-pinghu","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"平沪南运线（文物南迁）"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"文物南迁·平汉—陇海—津浦线"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1933-02-05","end":"1933-05-15","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[116.397,39.918],[116.29,39.85],[115.48,38.87],[114.51,38.04],[113.63,34.75],[115.65,34.41],[117.18,34.26],[117.36,32.92],[118.72,32.09],[118.73,32.09],[119.45,32.2],[119.97,31.81],[120.3,31.57],[120.62,31.3],[121.47,31.23]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"北平"},"coord":[116.397,39.918],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1933-02-05","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"郑州"},"coord":[113.63,34.75],"role":"转陇海线东行"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"徐州"},"coord":[117.18,34.26],"role":"转津浦线南下"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"浦口"},"coord":[118.72,32.09],"role":"卸车，装江轮"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"上海"},"coord":[121.47,31.23],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1933-03","precision":"month"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"},{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁考察"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1933 年五批文物的南下路线：平汉铁路到郑州，转陇海铁路东行到徐州，再循津浦铁路南下到浦口，卸车装船，由江轮运抵上海。全线约两千公里，走了三个月。示意线，按沿途大站连成。"},"tags":["路线","文物","抗日战争"]},{"id":"route.wenwu-huning","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"沪宁转运线（存沪文物迁京）"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"沪宁铁路·文物转运"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1936-12-08","end":"1936-12-22","precision":"day"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[121.47,31.23],[120.62,31.3],[120.3,31.57],[119.97,31.81],[119.45,32.2],[118.73,32.09],[118.772,32.041]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"上海北站"},"coord":[121.47,31.23],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1936-12-08","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南京下关"},"coord":[118.73,32.09]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"朝天宫"},"coord":[118.772,32.041],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1936-12-22","precision":"day"}}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"},{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁考察"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"1936 年 12 月 8—22 日，存沪文物分五批走沪宁线：汽车从上海两处库房运到北站，火车到南京下关，再转汽车进朝天宫保存库。这段路只有三百公里，却是文物从「寄存」变为「分院收藏」的一步。"},"tags":["路线","文物","南京"]},{"id":"route.wenwu-nanlu","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁·南路"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁南路"},{"zh-Hans":"南京—长沙—贵阳—安顺—巴县"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-08-14","end":"1944-11","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.78,32.06],[114.3,30.59],[112.94,28.23],[110.29,25.27],[109.41,24.33],[106.63,26.65],[105.93,26.25],[106.55,29.56],[106.53,29.4]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南京"},"coord":[118.78,32.06],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-08-14","precision":"day"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"汉口"},"coord":[114.3,30.59],"role":"建国轮换火车"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"长沙"},"coord":[112.94,28.23],"role":"存湖南大学图书馆底层"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"桂林"},"coord":[110.29,25.27],"role":"绕道桂林"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"贵阳"},"coord":[106.63,26.65],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-01","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"安顺"},"coord":[105.93,26.25],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1939-01","precision":"month"},"role":"华严洞"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"巴县"},"coord":[106.53,29.4],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1944-11","precision":"month"},"role":"一品场石油沟"}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"南路：1937 年 8 月 14 日 80 箱由建国轮自南京起运，到汉口换火车到长沙，存湖南大学图书馆底层近五个月；1938 年 1 月起绕道桂林分两批迁贵阳，1939 年 1 月入安顺华严洞，1944 年秋再迁四川巴县一品场石油沟。示意线，按沿途大站连成。"},"tags":["路线","文物","抗日战争","西迁"]},{"id":"route.wenwu-zhonglu","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁·中路"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁中路"},{"zh-Hans":"南京—汉口—宜昌—重庆—乐山"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-11","end":"1939","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.78,32.06],[114.3,30.59],[111.29,30.69],[108.41,30.81],[106.55,29.56],[103.76,29.58]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南京"},"coord":[118.78,32.06],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-11","precision":"month"}},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"汉口"},"coord":[114.3,30.59]},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"宜昌"},"coord":[111.29,30.69],"role":"换小船入川"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"重庆"},"coord":[106.55,29.56],"role":"安达森洋行、川康平民商业银行"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"乐山"},"coord":[103.76,29.58],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1939","precision":"year"},"role":"安谷镇祠堂"}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"中路：1937 年 11 月起运，9,000 余箱沿长江上溯到汉口、宜昌，换小船入川。在重庆分存安达森洋行（3,694 箱）与川康平民商业银行（3,830 箱），1938 年底重庆开始挨炸后转乐山安谷，借「朱、潘、刘」三氏祠堂等六处祠堂存放近八年。示意线，水路为主。"},"tags":["路线","文物","抗日战争","西迁"]},{"id":"route.wenwu-beilu","type":"route","labels":{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁·北路"},"aliases":[{"zh-Hans":"文物西迁北路"},{"zh-Hans":"南京—宝鸡—汉中—成都—峨眉"}],"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1937-11","end":"1939","precision":"year"},"space":{"lines":[{"geometry":{"type":"LineString","coordinates":[[118.78,32.06],[118.72,32.09],[117.18,34.26],[113.63,34.75],[108.94,34.34],[107.14,34.37],[107.02,33.07],[105.84,32.44],[104.07,30.67],[103.48,29.6]]}}],"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"南京下关"},"coord":[118.73,32.09],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1937-11","precision":"month"},"role":"火车轮渡过江"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"宝鸡"},"coord":[107.14,34.37],"role":"城隍庙、关帝庙"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"汉中"},"coord":[107.02,33.07],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1938-03-13","precision":"day"},"role":"文庙、范家祠堂"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"成都"},"coord":[104.07,30.67],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1939-02-22","precision":"day"},"role":"大慈寺"},{"name":{"zh-Hans":"峨眉"},"coord":[103.48,29.6],"time":{"kind":"instant","at":"1939","precision":"year"},"role":"武庙、大佛寺"}]},"sources":[{"ref":"source.web.故宫文物南迁"}],"summary":{"zh-Hans":"北路：1937 年 11 月下旬自下关经火车轮渡过江，循津浦、陇海到宝鸡，存城隍庙与关帝庙；潼关吃紧后翻秦岭到汉中（1938 年 3 月 13 日首批），存文庙、范家祠堂；汉中两次被炸，1939 年 2 月 22 日起转成都大慈寺，再转峨眉武庙、大佛寺。示意线，按沿途大站连成。"},"tags":["路线","文物","抗日战争","西迁"]}]}